# Blaze of Glory is an instant cast "during combat before blockers are declared": the beginning of combat step counts, with
# no attackers yet declared (a defending player is then any opponent of the attacking player, CR 506.2). It lasts "this turn":
# on turn 3 Ironroot Treefolk blocks both Border Guard and Ageless Guardian (it must, CR 509.1c); a second Blaze cast in the declare blockers
# step is refused (CR 601.3), with a second Mox Pearl untapped to pay for it. On turn 5 the same attackers come again and the Treefolk may block only one of them, or none.

